Error: Jet.ImmutableAssignment: `cur` was made with `:`, so it can't be changed
  --> Tests/UI/iter_cursor_immutable_binding.jet:20:12
    |
 20 |     a: cur.next()
    |            ^^^^
 Why: `next: fn(^self)` changes the value it's called on, so `cur` must be changeable (`^`)
 Fix: Add `^` before the name: `^cur: ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ImmutableAssignment
